<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of rain affected English</p>
<p>Sunday league cricket matches:</p>
<p>At Derby: Derbyshire v Surrey match abandoned.</p>
<p>At Hartlepool: Nottinghamshire beat Durham by nine wickets.</p>
<p>Durham 155-8 in 23 overs innings closed. Nottinghamshire 157-1</p>
<p>(P.Johnson 74).</p>
<p>At Worcester: Leicestershire beat Worcestershire by six</p>
<p>runs. Worcestershire 92-9 in 16 overs, innings closed.</p>
<p>Leicestrershire 98-8.</p>
<p>At Lord's: Middlesex beat Sussex by seven wickets. Sussex</p>
<p>131-9 innnings closed. Middlesex 132-3 in 27 overs (M.Ramprakash</p>
<p>57 not out).</p>
<p>At Bristol: Gloucestershire v Hampshire match drawn.</p>
<p>Gloucesershire 139-5 in 16 overs, innings closed (M.Lynch 88 not</p>
<p>out) - rain.</p>
<p>At Northampton: Northampton v Somerset match abandoned.</p>
<p>At Headingley: Yorkshire beat Glamorgan by seven wickets.</p>
<p>Glamorgan 192-6 in 32 overs. Yorkshire 193-3 in 26.3 overs</p>
<p>(D.Byas 83).</p>
</text>
